The finding claims that account identifiers are disclosed in committed artifacts. However, the code region explicitly shows that the 'account_id' entries are part of the scan's summary totals (Totals by category: account_id: 9) and per-file detail lines that list local_path, hostname, connector_name, and account_id as categories of detected data. The line 'account_id x2: admin@example.com' is a sample entry within the per-file detail, not a committed artifact exposing raw account identifiers beyond what the scan itself categorizes. The finding misinterprets the nature of the data as a disclosure issue when it is a categorized scan result.